    "created_at": "2015-11-23T20:12:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T20:12:49Z",
    "body": "> There are many precedents for this in the spec.\n\nThese are not actually precedents about UI. They are about click events, or about mutability (which is about allowing the `.value` property to change), or about requireness (which is about allowing `.submit()` to succeed). All of these are about programmer-visible behavior, not about user-visible behavior.\n\nWe don't mandate anything about UI in general, including disabling or enabling UI. We sometimes provide guidance, and indeed maybe we should provide guidance that autofill=\"off\" is best off ignored by implementers. We'll see. It's good you brought this mismatch to our attention, as we want the spec to follow browsers here more closely.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/159050252/reactions",
