    "created_at": "2015-11-23T20:56:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T20:56:14Z",
    "body": "Okay great. I'll leave it in your capable hands :)\n\nI'd encourage you to jump into the discussion on https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=468153. The Chrome team seem firmly in the 'autofill off is best ignored' camp, whereas all the developers on the forum are firmly in the 'autofill off means autofill off' camp.\n\nThere is confusion because the Chrome team are talking from a security angle, whereas the developers are talking from a usabilty angle. I have a suspicion that Chrome are very concerned about mobile, where autofill is so important (given the cumbersome keyboard entry) that they are inclined to introduce it even if the developer has specifically asked for it to be turned off. All the developers (myself included) think this is a mistake.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
