    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T21:03:59Z",
    "body": "@domenic by the way, I'm concerned by your statement \"Autofill off is a user-hostile feature\". This is very much _not_ the case.\n\nAs the developers on https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=468153 attest, if autofill is not respected it destroys usability for any web site (and there are lots) that implement server-side lookups of data. The HTML-based dropdown is obscured by the browser-based autofill one. See screenshot:\n\nhttps://chromium.googlecode.com/issues/attachment?aid=4681530113000&name=Untitled.png&token=ABZ6GAeVnsjMqF5nchE_qDF_HTtMb6L0tg%3A1448312407530&id=468153&mod_ts_token=ABZ6GAf3VS8eh_C5WqzVQW5oM_xWDK8dhw%3A1448312407530&inline=1\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
